:DOCNUM.0080
:TITLE.DISKPRY
:BODY
A general purpose utility for EDF minidisks.  Can be used to examine and
modify individual blocks, copy minidisks block-by-block, search for data
in disk blocks, and recreate files from disk blocks.  DISKPRY can be used
to diagnose problems with crashed minidisks, retrieve files accidentally
erased, and for salvaging data from HDAs that are failing.  For SP2 and SP3.
:AUTHOR.Richard (Dick) Johnson
